Attribution
-----------

This is an independent, unofficial implementation of the LocalSend protocol written in
Rust with GTK 4 and libadwaita. It is not a fork of, and contains no source code from, the
upstream LocalSend project:

  LocalSend — https://localsend.org — https://github.com/localsend/localsend
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The wire protocol it implements is documented at https://github.com/localsend/protocol.

"LocalSend" and the LocalSend logo are used only to describe interoperability and are the
property of the LocalSend project. This client is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or
endorsed by the LocalSend project or its maintainers.

